<details class="tracking-privacy">
 <summary>Privacy choices</summary>
 <div>
  <p>Control Google Analytics, Google Ads and Microsoft Clarity for this browser. Your choice does not affect proposal forms or staff sign-in.</p>
  <p data-tracking-status role="status">JavaScript is needed to manage this browser’s choice. Without it, these tracking scripts do not run.</p>
  <div class="tracking-actions">
   <button type="button" data-tracking-choice="off" hidden>Turn off analytics and replay</button>
   <button type="button" data-tracking-choice="on" hidden>Allow analytics and replay</button>
  </div>
  <p>This choice reloads the page. It does not erase information already sent or remove existing provider cookies. <a href="/privacy/">Read the Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
 </div>
</details>
